1
00:00:12,216 --> 00:00:16,004
Tu m'invites à ta pendaison de crémaillère ?
Are you inviting me to your housewarming?

2
00:00:16,104 --> 00:00:23,948
Bien sûr ! Je t'ai écrit un message hier. Je te donne l'adresse.
Of course! I wrote you a message yesterday. I'll give you the address.

3
00:00:24,048 --> 00:00:27,020
Qu'est-ce que je peux t'apporter ?
What can I bring you?

4
00:00:27,120 --> 00:00:31,844
Apporte-moi quelque chose à boire, ça suffit.
Bring me something to drink, that's enough.

5
00:00:31,944 --> 00:00:36,884
Et les voisins ? Tu leur as demandé de venir ?
And the neighbours? Did you ask them to come?

6
00:00:36,984 --> 00:00:43,100
Oui, je leur ai parlé hier. Ils arrivent à vingt heures.
Yes, I spoke to them yesterday. They arrive at eight p.m.
